# CatDex — State Management

## Stores (`src/store/`)

| Store | Role |
|-------|------|
| `useAuthStore` | Session, onboarding flag, OAuth/email auth |
| `useCatsStore` | Local collection + sync |
| `useMissionsStore` | Missions + streak |
| `usePendingCaptureStore` | Scan → reward handoff |
| `useMapExploreStore` | Map explore UI state |
| `useSettingsPrefsStore` | Haptics, sounds, prefs |
| `useThemeLabStore` | Theme lab overrides |
| `useToastStore` | Toasts |

## Rules

- One concern per store; don’t dump UI-only ephemeral state into auth/cats
- Persist only what must survive restarts (auth, cats, missions, prefs)
- Updates: immutable patterns (spread / return new objects)
- After successful `addCat`, clear pending capture
- Read with selectors: `useCatsStore((s) => s.cats)` to limit rerenders

## Anti-patterns

- Duplicating server truth without a sync story
- Storing large base64 forever in pending without cleanup
- Calling network inside every component instead of store/lib actions
